---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '在中国付款失败时该怎么办';
const description = "外国游客在中国支付失败的常见原因及解决方法——二维码支付不通时的排查步骤。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>返回付款</a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        What to Do When Your Payment Fails in China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">不要惊慌——大多数付款失败都很容易解决。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读4分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>付款失败对外国用户来说很常见。</strong>大多数是由每日限额、银行欺诈阻止或网络问题引起的。尝试切换到现金、使用其他应用程序或连接到WiFi。如果没有任何效果，请等待几个小时，然后重试。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">这将在某个时候发生。你在一家商店，扫描二维码，应用程序旋转了一会儿，然后——出错了。付款失败。</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">别慌。在中国，支付失败对外国用户来说很常见，大多数时候这是一个简单的解决方案。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔍</span>为什么会发生</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">1.你已达到每日限额</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">支付宝和微信支付都对你可以花多少钱有限制。如果你一直在购物，你可能会碰到天花板。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>修复：</strong>等到第二天——每日限额重置。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">2.您的银行阻止了该交易</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">你的银行看到来自中国的指控，认为这是欺诈。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong>检查你的通知——你的银行通常会发送一条短信询问是否是你。批准后重试。旅行前通知您的银行以避免这种情况。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">3.网络问题</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">您的VPN可能已断开连接，或者商家的互联网速度很慢。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong>检查您的VPN，打开/关闭飞行模式，或询问商家是否可以重试。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-lg">4.商户不接受国际卡</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">一些较小的供应商的支付账户只适用于中国银行卡。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2"><strong>Fix:</strong>使用现金，或者询问他们是否接受微信支付（有时在支付宝不接受的情况下有效）。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span>快速故障排除检查表</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>切换到其他应用程序</strong>--如果支付宝失败，请尝试微信支付（反之亦然）</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>使用现金</strong>--始终携带500-1000日元的小额钞票作为备用</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>连接到WiFi</strong>--向商家索要WiFi；有时蜂窝数据是问题所在</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>重新启动应用程序</strong>--关闭并重新打开支付宝或微信</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <div><strong>等待并重试</strong>--有些问题几分钟后就会自行解决</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何在中国付款</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整的付款概览</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何设置支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">分步设置指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">支付宝-消费者中心</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cs.help.wechat.com/hc/en-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">微信-帮助中心</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>